ia-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 2" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 6px #F0D06080" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 3" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed md:flex-1">Use 1st Skill to slow enemies,then her Ultimate for Control Effect,then use the 2nd Skill to restore allies&#x27; HP.</p></div></div></section></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="hero-overview relative lg:pl-4 lg:border-l lg:border-[#C8AA6E]/30"><span class="hidden lg:block absolute left-0 top-0 w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0D060] via-[#C8AA6E] to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-[15px]">Rafaela is not a healer in the MMO sense. She is a tempo support who turns messy skirmishes into winnable ones by forcing movement speed, revealing ambushes, and buying one extra second for the right teammate. Pick her when that extra second wins the fight. Leave her alone when your draft needs a real frontliner or the enemy can erase her before the second cast lands.</p></div><section class="dossier-card relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border-default overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" aria-label="Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-mlbb-gold/0 via-mlbb-gold-bright/60 to-mlbb-gold/0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="abso