\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Radiant Armor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Radiant Armor (1,880 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Anti-Sustain Aura build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-anti-sustain-aura\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Anti-Sustain Aura build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-anti-sustain-aura\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T99e,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Rafaela in Mobile Legends: Roam Sprint Chase Control\",\"description\":\"Greedier rotation setup for low-lockdown drafts where Sprint, Rapid Boots, and Ice Queen Wand let Rafaela reveal, slow, and keep allies moving through chase fights.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Rapid Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Sprint Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Rapid Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Rapid Boots (750 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Flask of the Oasis\",\"text\":\"Purchase Flask of the Oasis (1,850 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Ice Queen Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Ice Queen Wand (2,040 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Fleeting Time\",\"text\":\"Purchase Fleeting Time (2,050 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Sprint Chase Control build for Rafaela.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela#build-roam-sprint-chase-control\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/rafaela\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-20T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"Rafaela\",\"slug\":\"rafaela\",\"title\":\"Wings of Holiness\",\"role\":[\"Support\"],\"specialty\":[\"Regen\",\"Guard\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\"],\"tier\":\"S\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":60,\"offense\":20,\"controlEffect\":70,\"difficulty\":40},\"winRate\":57.92,\"pickRate\":1.26,\"banRate\":19.14,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"masha\",\"heroName\":\"Masha\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Rafaela has great healing and decent mobility, and performs well against heroes that lack burst damage or mobility, such as Masha and Barats.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"barats\",\"heroName\":\"Barats\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Rafaela has great healing and decent mobility, and performs well against heroes that lack burst damage or mobility, such as Masha and Barats.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"ling\",\"heroName\":\"Ling\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Rafaela struggles against bursty and agile Assassins, like Ling and Hayabusa.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Rafaela struggles against bursty and agile Assassins, like Ling and Hayabusa.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_491618ae5cb3d561f5f02fbb3d82a83d.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_68277dce415742c4a98883151c693a07.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"1\",\"heroName\":\"Miya\",\"heroSlug\":\"miya\",\"icon\":\"https://indoch.s3.ml.moonlian.com/web/madmin/image_a844f9aa51baefa6878801edd85fec5e.png\",\"tip\":\"Both are pretty slow and squishy, but if they use their passives correctly, may be a deadly duo. Miya's passive make her basic attacks faster while Rafaela's passive can catch up a enemies easily for Miya to finish off.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"24\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_50b8723a3ca11dd18d34d26948aef12b.png\",\"tip\":\"Rafaela's Holy of Retribution can easily force Natalia out of her invisible mode so she can't attacks teammates from behind.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"42\",\"heroName\":\"Harley\",\"heroSlug\":\"harley\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a2f1d7806d874283c83913f14a533bb0.png\",\"tip\":\"His ultimate's slowdown may put Rafaela's into a dangerous situation and can easily kill her with the right combos.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Divine Resurrection\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Rafaela can cast a special skill every 10s. After channeling for 2.5s, she instantly resurrects an ally and increases their Movement Speed by 30% for 5s (taking damage from heroes and Legend Creeps interrupts channeling and puts the skill on base cooldown).\\nThis skill's cooldown is increased by 600% of the target's remaining respawn time, capped at 240s. This skill is not affected by Cooldown Reduction.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rafaela can cast a special skill every 10s. After channeling for 2.5s, she instantly resurrects an ally and increases their Movement Speed by 30% for 5s (taking damage from heroes and Legend Creeps interrupts channeling and puts the skill on base cooldown).\\nThis skill's cooldown is increased by 600% of the target's remaining respawn time, capped at 240s. This skill is not affected by Cooldown Reduction.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eb33edd56da79e4dbe8601648e2cb07a.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Light of Retribution\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Rafaela strikes the three nearest enemies with Light of Retribution, dealing them 350 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, briefly revealing their positions, and slowing them by 40% for 1.5s. Enemies hit by Light of Retribution again within 6s will take 20% extra damage (this effect stacks up to 3 times).\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rafaela strikes the three nearest enemies with \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Light of Retribution\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", dealing them 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage, briefly revealing their positions, and slowing them by 40% for 1.5s. Enemies hit by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Light of Retribution\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" again within 6s will take 20% extra damage (this effect stacks up to 3 times).\"}],\"cooldown\":\"5s\",\"manaCost\":\"45\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e3672153fbf1dbeb4a98243958f9deb7.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Holy Healing\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Rafaela calls upon Holy Light, recovering 100 (+35% Total Magic Power) HP to nearby allied heroes, plus an additional 150 (+65% Total Magic Power) HP to herself and the most injured allied hero in range. She also increases the Movement Speed of nearby allied heroes by 30% and grants Slow Immunity for 1s.\\nEvery 10 Magic Power increases the Movement Speed bonus by 1%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rafaela calls upon Holy Light, recovering 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+35% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP to nearby allied heroes, plus an additional 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+65% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" HP to herself and the most injured allied hero in range. She also increases the Movement Speed of nearby allied heroes by 30% and grants Slow Immunity for 1s.\\nEvery 10 \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Power\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" increases the Movement Speed bonus by 1%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"10.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"75\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png\",\"tags\":[\"Heal\",\"Speed Up\"]},{\"name\":\"Holy Baptism\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Rafaela unleashes the true power of Holy Light in the target direction, dealing 460 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in a line and stunning them for 1.2s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rafaela unleashes the true power of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Holy Light\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 460\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies in a line and stunning them for 1.2s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"38s\",\"manaCost\":\"120\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"AOE\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Upgrape Holy Healing S2 first.\\nPurify will be surely helpful since you must survive in order to assist your teammates.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Upgrape Holy Healing S2 first.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Purify will be surely helpful since you must survive in order to assist your teammates. \"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"freya\",\"heroName\":\"Freya\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"When teamed up with Fighters like Freya and Lapu-Lapu, Rafaela can boost their offensive power and survivability.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lapu-lapu\",\"heroName\":\"Lapu-Lapu\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"When teamed up with Fighters like Freya and Lapu-Lapu, Rafaela can boost their offensive power and survivability.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use 1st Skill to slow enemies,then her Ultimate for Control Effect,then use the 2nd Skill to restore allies' HP.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1410,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e3672153fbf1dbeb4a98243958f9deb7.png\"},{\"skillId\":1430,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png\"},{\"skillId\":1420,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"Use 1st Skill to poke enemiesand 2nd to heal and create distance.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1410,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e3672153fbf1dbeb4a98243958f9deb7.png\"},{\"skillId\":1420,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Rafaela build, counter, and guide for MLBB. Enchanted Talisman plus Flask spike, roam timing, anti-dive positioning, emblem choices, and draft traps explained.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Rafaela is not a healer in the MMO sense. She is a tempo support who turns messy skirmishes into winnable ones by forcing movement speed, revealing ambushes, and buying one extra second for the right teammate. Pick her when that extra second wins the fight. Leave her alone when your draft needs a real frontliner or the enemy can erase her before the second cast lands.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"rafaela\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-favor-tempo\",\"name\":\"Roam Favor Tempo\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"cost\":1850,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"flask-of-the-oasis\",\"name\":\"Flask of the Oasis\"},{\"slug\":\"fleeting-time\",\"name\":\"Fleeting Time\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"favor\",\"name\":\"Favor\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rapid-boots\",\"name\":\"Rapid Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy has low chain crowd control and Rafaela's first-rotation tempo matters more than Fortitude.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when sustain fighters, shield supports, or attack-speed carries are forcing extended front-to-back fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one magic burst combo can delete Rafaela before the second Holy Healing cycle.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a predictable dive combo reaches Rafaela before Flicker or Holy Baptism can create peel.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked roam setup built around Favor, mana uptime, Flask saves, ultimate resets, and enough self-survival to stay near the carry line.\",\"totalCost\":10650,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":135,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Flask of the Oasis\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Fleeting Time\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":2850,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":38,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":50,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Flask of the Oasis\",\"Fleeting Time\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"healingEffect\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.healingEffect\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":12,\"sources\":[\"Flask of the Oasis\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=rafaela\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cenchanted-talisman%2Cflask-of-the-oasis%2Cfleeting-time%2Coracle%2Cimmortality\u0026blessing=favor\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=support\u0026talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark\u0026flex=rapid-boots.tough-boots%2Cdominance-i