"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Draft her when your team wants to run at people\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Rafaela is correct when your draft already has someone else to start the fight and at least one damage dealer who benefits from faster entries. Assassins like Hayabusa, Lancelot, and Nolan love her because Holy Healing shortens the distance they need to cover, while Light of Retribution slows the target that is trying to run. Short-range bruisers also benefit. Yu Zhong, Arlott, and Barats look much better when their first contact is backed by a speed surge and an easy line stun behind it. Patch 2.1.88 (\",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/patch-notes\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"patch notes\"}],\") leaned into this: her early Light of Retribution damage jumped, her revive returns far faster in the opening game, and her skill mana costs dropped, so she now adds real lane pressure on top of the speed and stun she always brought.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"She is also one of the cleanest answers to conceal and bush pressure. Light of Retribution checks bushes without forcing your body into them: it strikes the three nearest enemies and briefly reveals their positions, so a hidden target gives up its angle for free. That matters against Natalia, Aamon, and Lesley setups where one missed bush check can cost the lane before the real fight starts.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The trap drafts are easy to spot. Do not lock Rafaela when your team has no honest front line and expects you to stand in vision first. Do not lock her when the enemy can stack anti-heal and direct dive at the same time, especially Baxia plus an assassin. Do not lock her just because your gold laner asked for \\\"a healer\\\". If the fight is decided by hard engage and burst in one second, Rafaela arrives one cast too late.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L7e\",\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\"],\"$L8c\",\"$L8d\"],\"$L8e\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a5:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb5:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6d:[\"$\",\"$L6a\",\"minotaur\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/minotaur\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"src\":\"ht